"2s.png"],"raw":"74158","sources":[],"status":"observed","value":["74158"]},"varieties_english":{"evidence":"Alliance for Coffee Excellence 的 Ethiopia 2024 官方结果表在 VARIETY 栏多次列出 74158，证实该数字编号可直接用作品种英文名称。","frames":["2s.png"],"raw":"74158","sources":["https://allianceforcoffeeexcellence.org/ethiopia-2024/"],"status":"inferred","value":[{"english":"74158","original":"74158","sources":["https://allianceforcoffeeexcellence.org/ethiopia-2024/"]}]}},"display":{"country":"埃塞俄比亚 Ethiopia","farm":"","flavors":"[\"黄色花香\", \"秋月梨\", \"黄桃\", \"李子\", \"佛手柑\", \"黄糖\"]","green_supplier":"","official_flavors":"是","price_per_g":"","process":"遮阴干燥慢速日晒","process_category":"日晒","process_detail":"遮阴干燥慢速","product_name":"TOH #2","region":"Sidama Arbegona","roast_date":"","roast_level":"浅烘","roaster":"Armin","varieties":"[\"74158\"]","varieties_english":"[{\"original\": \"74158\", \"english\": \"74158\", \"sources\": [\"https://allianceforcoffeeexcellence.org/ethiopia-2024/\"]}]"},"id":66,"number":"B000066","photos":[],"recipe":{},"recipe_stage_display":[],"sources":[{"coffee_id":66,"created_at":"2026-11-05T11:24:09.978058+00:00","id":179,"kind":"video","raw_text":"【2s.png】\nArmin | TOH #2\n埃塞 Sidama Arbegona\n74158 | 遮阴干燥慢速日晒\n黄色花香/秋月梨/黄桃/\n李子/佛手柑/黄糖\n17g x (1:16=4x4)，92度\n幻刺pro7.5-8.5，v60\n────────────\n很奇怪，这次冲的并不好喝\n首先风味好像都在，但是\n没那么饱满和具象\n然后好像有一股奇怪的感觉\n冲击到了胸口，有点类似\n咖啡因过多的感觉\n总之比较难以下咽\n不知道是什么造成的\n\n【end_2s.png】\n无字幕。","video_id":119},{"coffee_id":66,"created_at":"2026-11-05T11:22:57.779164+00:00","id":178,"kind":"video","raw_text":"【2s.png】\nArmin | TOH #2\n埃塞 Sidama Arbegona\n74158 | 遮阴干燥慢速日晒\n黄色花香/秋月梨/黄桃/\n李子/佛手柑/黄糖\n15g x (1:16=4x4), 92度\n幻刺pro7.5-8.5，Ran\n────────────\n高温有黄色花香，但没啥味道\n降了点温之后味道都出来了\n几种风味都能喝到，除了黄糖\n可惜要出门了，没细细品\n口感依然非常顺滑，过渡非常好\nRan还是太牛了\n不过风味分布感觉有点太集中了\n打的不够开，可能用v60会更适合\n\n【end_2s.png】\n无字幕。","video_id":118}]}